  "description": "Gives you Words: every user-facing string in a words.ini, looked up by key in the right language — fallbacks, plural forms by Unicode CLDR's rules, {0} and {Name} parameters, {>key} references, a markdown dialect. The engine; pair it with PatTech.Localization.WPF or PatTech.Localization.Avalonia for XAML.",
